# Dataset: Sensor Data (Confidential_341Project_DataSet7)

This dataset contains time-series sensor readings used for analyzing environmental or system-based changes over time. It was used in the ISAT 341 project to detect trends, outliers, and significant differences in sensor behavior.

# Features
- Timestamped sensor readings (columns may include temperature, humidity, pressure, or other measurable units)
- Potential missing values or noise for data cleaning practice
- Used for statistical testing (e.g., t-tests) and visualization

